命卫队称该船触雷，但海事安全机构表示暂无独立证据确认这一说法。本月已有20多艘船只在相关海域遭袭，霍尔木兹海峡原油运输量截至10月12日当周平均为每天850万桶，较伊朗战争前正常水平低近40%。","sourceName":"CNBC Top News","sourceUrl":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/14/container-ship-sinks-strait-hormuz-as-iran-war-attacks.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-14T15:47:29.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7e8ce065105487100c687f545f71e93c52c1c1932a32143bdd0fb0fffc4d7d49.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/0bbfd8b9f25f24983634e6e6abd82994e0befec127adb0ea475e2dab16084c08.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7e8ce065105487100c687f545f71e93c52c1c1932a32143bdd0fb0fffc4d7d49.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"美国9月CPI同比增长3.7%推升美联储加息预期，现货黄金跌破4100美元","summary":"美国9月CPI同比增长3.7%，高于预期的3.6%；核心CPI同比增长2.6%，也高于预期的2.5%。数据发布后，交易员增加对10月美联储加息的押注，并预计到2027年底还将加息三次；现货黄金报4119.03美元/盎司，现货白银报57.81美元/盎司，美元指数升至102.52。","sourceName":"东方财富","sourceUrl":"http://finance.eastmoney.com/news/1345,202610143895658536.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-14T12:30:40.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"related":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/37ea346353e612445d84b46266c2d66f6c1804dcbe725a99a35373e78ce4a3bf.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/e305f14ac3c89a8eea5964e7526b7ce6185e048a2b6a69dc244016bd8d40f48b.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/37ea346353e612445d84b46266c2d66f6c1804dcbe725a99a35373e78ce4a3bf.webp 96w","itemId":"k9gaiy05hm4d3d73koreqh7ut","title":"美国9月CPI升至3.7%推动Bitcoin跌破82,000美元","summary":null,"sourceName":"Cointelegraph","sourceUrl":"https://cointelegraph.com/markets/bitcoin-price-dips-yields-surge-as-high-oil-prices-spike-us-cpi-inflation?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound","publishedAt":"2026-10-14T14:21:15.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true}],"citationId":"ns7787ljnli8luwjqt618ko1m"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/79a5eb1742a839a34e8eba3975a15b3e2c76c9a88080b44a4f7703dd2968e315.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"HEX 及 PulseChain 创始人 Richard Heart 在伊斯坦布尔被捕","summary":"据 ChainCatcher 援引 Bitcoin.com News 和土耳其媒体报道，HEX 及 PulseChain 创始人 Richard Heart 在伊斯坦布尔被土耳其国家情报组织与警方联合拘留。","sourceName":"链捕手 ChainCatcher","sourceUrl":"https://www.chaincatcher.com/article/2296271","publishedAt":"2026-10-14T13:35:06.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":3,"citationId":"piibokx1jqf9oviuvqezwrzuv"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2cd8f96042d65c570d5aeba09ed82b994df30d57b7996e76abd7c263e69143ac.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"高通胀如何成为美国消费者的“生活常态”","summary":"美国9月CPI同比上涨3.7%，连续约65个月高于美联储普遍接受的2%通胀目标。CNBC分析称，这是21世纪最长的一段连续超标时期；纽约联储调查显示，消费者9月的一年期通胀预期升至3.9%，为三年多来最高。文章指出，消费者和企业若据此调整消费、工资与定价行为，可能使通胀预期更难控制；利率上升虽可能抑制通胀，短期也会增加借贷压力。","sourceName":"CNBC Top News","sourceUrl":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/14/high-inflation-fed-expectations.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-14T17:20:23.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"lvu5v6z05o9qfkhl4nrwhcn3g"},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":null,"title":"菲律宾最大加密交易所Coins.ph据称面临央行监管行动","summary":"据两名知情人士称，菲律宾最大加密交易所Coins.ph因被指服务境外博彩平台，正面临菲律宾中央银行的处罚行动，严重情况下可能被吊销运营牌照。菲律宾中央银行本月初据报限制通过Coins.ph主要钱包公司DCPay Philippines向交易所存款，Coins.ph拥有超过1800万名客户，并控制菲律宾比索兑稳定币流动性的约75%-80%。","sourceName":"CoinDesk","sourceUrl":"https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/10/13/largest-philippines-crypto-exchange-coins-ph-said-to-face-central-bank-regulatory-action","publishedAt":"2026-10-14T01:00:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":2,"citationId":"atskn750aulxmnvjayaiyt7ld"},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":null,"title":"IMF上调全球经济增长预期并警告通胀与能源风险","summary":"10月13日，IMF发布《世界经济展望报告》，将2026年全球经济增长预期上调至3.1%，较7月预测值高0.1个百分点，但预计全球总体通胀率将从2025年的4.1%升至2026年的4.7%。IMF预计2026年石油均价为每桶95.74美元，较2025年上涨约41%，并警告石油库存下降、能源价格上升和财政可持续性风险可能削弱全球经济韧性。","sourceName":"经济观察网","sourceUrl":"http://www.eeo.com.cn/2026/1013/1063034.shtml","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T10:26:05.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"citationId":"darvjb6b3huzeuddcxp5c25gw"}]},{"label":"股票市场","summary":null,"items":[{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":null,"title":"股票交易强劲助高盛克服固定收益业务疲软，第三季度净利润增长30%","summary":"高盛第三季度净利润增长30%，股票交易员的表现推动业绩上升。股票交易强劲抵消了华尔街固定收益业务疲软的影响。","sourceName":"Financial Times","sourceUrl":"https://www.ft.com/content/56f4a46e-3ae5-4aea-8cf3-71506b286091","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T09:42:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":2,"citationId":"wc8rmwfldv1l1ltbn95gdteyg"}]},{"label":"行业动态","summary":null,"items":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Kraken将收购受欧盟监管的Saldo Bank，预计2027年完成","summary":"据《金融时报》报道，Kraken将收购受欧盟监管的Saldo Bank，交易预计于2027年完成。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a139c5-55e2-7330-9380-25ebd2fecff2","publishedAt":"2026-10-14T09:36:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":2,"citationId":"wdelcmynnn9r1lxjg0whlmudj"}]},{"label":"观点与教程","summary":null,"items":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bea8e42ecaae675437f1d85767b96c288a979621c45bc55640df59c09fbb8bcb.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7d7829b963afe835d4c9469a5d6120eb74c71d1e68c29cdeefc94446a6c51266.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bea8e42ecaae675437f1d85767b96c288a979621c45bc55640df59c09fbb8bcb.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Bank of America因洗钱和制裁违规被罚超12.1亿美元","summary":"Bank of America因洗钱和制裁违规被美国监管机构处以超过12.1亿美元罚款。Bloomberg表示，Katherine Doherty将在《The Asia Trade》中进一步介绍相关情况。","sourceName":"Bloomberg Markets","sourceUrl":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-10-13/bofa-fined-more-than-1-2-billion-for-money-laundering-video","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T23:58:52.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":4,"related":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2cd8f96042d65c570d5aeba09ed82b994df30d57b7996e76abd7c263e69143ac.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Bank of America因反洗钱违规被处以超过$1.2 billion罚款","summary":null,"sourceName":"CNBC Top News","sourceUrl":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/13/bank-of-america-treasury-money-laundering.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T20:45:01.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"fzo8l02ofgk5pxw0d2w5z7soo"}],"citationId":"pj8iya1v0wp6hv9by25q6nqqa"}]}],"flashes":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"美国OCC报告称九家大型银行曾以声誉风险为由限制数字资产企业服务","summary":"美国货币监理署（OCC）发布对九家大型银行的“去银行化”审查报告，称这些银行在2020年至2025年9月期间，均存在可能因政治、宗教观点或合法经营活动拒绝或限制服务的政策。受限行业包括数字资产活动、油气、煤炭、枪支弹药、拘留设施和烟草；审查涉及近10万份投诉及约42万页文件。OCC负责人Jonathan Gould称对银行近期整改是否足够没有信心，并表示将评估进一步调整大型银行监管框架。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a13b71-e0b6-7389-8a01-45efd978fb1a","publishedAt":"2026-10-14T17:24:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"citationId":"lcxtlw4c9cmdr2z0ielcnaq90"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"荷兰央行批准Qivalis电子货币机构牌照，拟推出MiCA合规欧元稳定币","summary":"荷兰央行已向阿姆斯特丹公司Qivalis授予电子货币机构牌照，允许其发行符合MiCA的欧元计价电子货币代币。Qivalis由37家欧洲银行支持，计划在未来数月推出1:1锚定欧元的稳定币；正式发行前仍需完成包括发布白皮书在内的MiCA剩余要求，代币将主要通过银行、加密货币交易所和支付服务商分发。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a13a30-8e02-753e-9f03-eb2aea6b8e81","publishedAt":"2026-10-14T11:33:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"gqcratvrqalu23mh7vfoqinmy"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"蓝天格锐非法集资案中检方申请没收6.18万余枚比特币等资产","summary":"天津市第二中级人民法院已于9月28日立案受理天津市人民检察院第二分院申请没收钱志敏违法所得一案。检方申请没收的财产包括61896.41552945枚比特币，以及其他虚拟货币、现金、珠宝和金融资产等。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a13858-3746-736c-b6c8-639c9a508710","publishedAt":"2026-10-14T02:57:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"related":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c805ddc63768b4f0fa179b6390f69b3d1685a403018bf6443a0365d5673b4862.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/37d4e70beec4574e9b457f547ecba779ae6a3ec96ca2f9d4a852ac50e9715247.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c805ddc63768b4f0fa179b6390f69b3d1685a403018bf6443a0365d5673b4862.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"天津法院受理没收钱志敏违法所得申请，涉及6.18万余枚比特币","summary":null,"sourceName":"界面新闻","sourceUrl":"https://www.jiemian.com/article/15188158.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-14T03:39:58.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"ddt6l62lfxg5gyq6hr359k0t7"}],"citationId":"qyv1ezstx81gqu5hjjbzdhlit"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"微软新增逾1300亿美元数据中心租约，计划将全球算力扩大逾两倍","summary":"微软单季新增逾1300亿美元数据中心租约，并计划到2032年将全球数据中心容量从约12吉瓦扩大至38吉瓦以上。该公司尚未启动的租约承诺总额升至3291亿美元，较上一季度增长超过67%；此前容量短缺已导致部分客户转向竞争对手。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783573","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T23:56:44.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"tg6xt8a9y724mi99ie6ixvdic"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"中国9月CPI同比上涨0.9%，PPI同比上涨5.0%","summary":"国家统计局数据显示，中国9月CPI同比上涨0.9%，涨幅较上月扩大0.1个百分点，汽油价格上涨16.6%是主要推手；PPI同比上涨5.0%，涨幅扩大1.2个百分点。国际原油、有色金属、煤炭价格上行，以及人工智能和算电协同发展带动电子制造业价格上涨，推动上游工业品通胀加快。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783584","publishedAt":"2026-10-14T02:06:20.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"citationId":"regjls0j0xo6ozmwar4mdtx5k"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"EBA将Circle发行的USDC认定为MiCA下首个重要EMT","summary":"欧洲银行管理局（EBA）将Circle Internet Financial Europe SAS发行的USDC认定为MiCA下首个重要电子货币代币（EMT）。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a13b3a-0c13-706c-a5a4-2df786bba447","publishedAt":"2026-10-14T16:23:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"gtm8ajxmm66fqav41atoxvqqf"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"ASML强劲业绩未能提振芯片股，费城半导体指数六连跌","summary":"费城半导体指数（SOX）周三收跌4.3%，连续第六个交易日下跌，过去六个交易日超过半数成分股跌幅至少达到10%。文章指出，利率上升、估值压力及AI基础设施建设成本引发担忧，SOX成分股面临超过1万亿美元的市值损失风险，但这并不代表市值已全部蒸发。ASML业绩强劲并上调全年销售指引仍未扭转板块跌势，市场正关注AI资本开支能否转化为可持续的收入、利润和现金流。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783642","publishedAt":"2026-10-14T20:45:20.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"s4ktuidijb59s4jc23k4gotdg"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Polygon Labs完成对Coinme收购，Open Money Stack覆盖美国受监管支付业务","summary":"Polygon Labs宣布完成对Coinme的收购，并将受监管的美国资金转移服务纳入 Polygon Open Money Stack。该业务覆盖美国48个州，持有37个州的货币传输牌照及11项适用豁免，并已在 FinCEN 注册为货币服务业务；Tazapay、Mesh、Toku 和 Kira 成为首批客户，应用于跨境商业支付、账户充值、全球薪资发放及美元服务。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a13a7e-da80-7539-87d8-ea9d638449ea","publishedAt":"2026-10-14T12:59:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"citationId":"aup450f2d069kzd6und8gqwt2"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c25a33f3f3500a495dc69cede8cf4fc350b907af79fc24007e68e0819db0747e.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/a192c125ac7c90e5e5369c2f6b25b235e5783c7c265d2b663f70de4fcda2fd35.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c25a33f3f3500a495dc69cede8cf4fc350b907af79fc24007e68e0819db0747e.webp 96w","itemId":"fi2y3yhbcmq1i4bgeddn0i0oa","title":"俄罗斯最大银行Sberbank获准交易Bitcoin，计划12月推出加密产品","summary":"俄罗斯央行将Sberbank列入获授权的数字货币交易机构名录，允许其用自有资金买卖加密资产；该行计划于12月1日在SberBank Online、SberInvestments和SberBusiness中推出Bitcoin、Ethereum和USDT产品。非合格投资者每年通过单一中介的交易上限为300,000卢布，须通过知识测试，且在俄罗斯使用加密货币支付商品仍属违法。","sourceName":"Decrypt","sourceUrl":"https://decrypt.co/380981/sberbank-russia-bank-trade-crypto-bitcoin","publishedAt":"2026-10-14T19:46:03.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"followUp":"2026-10-08"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Vortexa：美国封锁令伊朗海运原油出口归零，俄罗斯9月出口环比增6%","summary":"Vortexa数据显示，伊朗海运原油出口自9月第二周降至零，截至10月5日仍未恢复；俄罗斯9月原油出口环比增长6%，达到每日379万桶。伊朗滞留在油轮中的原油约8300万桶，其中约4300万桶被困在霍尔木兹海峡以西；伊朗液化石油气出口9月环比下降48%。伊朗、俄罗斯和委内瑞拉9月原油出口合计为每日473万桶，低于去年同期的每日639万桶。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783570","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T23:01:07.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"kld0zt4vand7frvyt7kwvw37y"}],"cover":null,"metrics":{"totalEvents":12,"sourcesCount":10,"firstPartyEvents":10},"readingMinutes":5,"prev":"2026-10-14","next":"202